# Every device and SoC directory needs an owner here; tools/check-devices.py
# fails when one is missing or does not list the device's maintainers.

# Device tree rules, schemas and checker
/devices/*.schema.json  @nmcmil
/socs/*.schema.json     @nmcmil
/tools/check-devices.py @nmcmil
/docs/devices.md        @nmcmil

# Imager catalog sources, schema and generator
/imager/                       @nmcmil
/tools/build-imager-catalog.py @nmcmil
/docs/imager-catalog.md        @nmcmil

# SoC families
/socs/qcom/milos/       @nmcmil

# Devices
/devices/fairphone/fp6/ @nmcmil
